# ── Localization ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Force a specific locale at build/start time (overrides auto-detection).
# See docs/dev/localization.md for details.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DF_LOCALE=es

# ── Updater ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# In-app updates stay disabled (no background check, no Updates settings tab)
# until Rambutan Slicer has its own signed update feed. Set to true only then.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_UPDATER_ENABLED=true
